1. Scope and definitions
"Software" means EG-Clicker code and documentation distributed under this
license. "Licensor" means the copyright holder identified above.
"Organization" includes a business and its parent, subsidiaries and other
entities under common control. Employee count is the total number of full-time
and part-time employees across that group worldwide at the time of use.
"Commercial use" means use in connection with business operations, paid work,
or other activity intended for commercial advantage or monetary compensation,
including internal business use and use by a contractor for a client. For use
on behalf of a client or employer, that organization's employee count applies.

