unmodified Software for:
(a) personal and noncommercial use; and
(b) commercial use by individuals and organizations with fewer than 100 employees.
Noncommercial use is permitted regardless of employee count. If an organization
reaches 100 employees, its commercial use requires the permission in section 3.
Inspection of the source and building an unchanged copy for a permitted use are
allowed. Ordinary installation, changing application settings, saving user data
and operating-system changes made automatically during execution are not
